the flooded areas on Elm ST and Riverside DR.  Academy ST may begin to flood via Cypress Branch on the east side of town."}, {"stage": 14, "statement": "Flooding reaches Main ST near Riverside DR and Elm ST. Flooding along Causey RD deepens and may reach the road in a few spots. Low lying structures on Main ST and Riverside DR may have water in them. Water may also affect Bardin ST. As the water rises beyond 14 feet, Main ST may become impassable near Riverside DR and Elm St and flooding will extend to the railroad. Low areas south of the railroad connected to the river via the canal south of the Hwy 904 bridge may flood as the water rises beyond 14 feet."}, {"stage": 13, "statement": "Flooding worsens along Main Street, Riverside Drive, and Causey Rd.  Low lying structures nearer the river on Main Street and Riverside drive may have water in them.  Some driveways along Causey Road may be flooded."}, {"stage": 12, "statement": "Water begins to affect Riverside Dr and yards along Main Street and Causey Road in Fair Bluff."}, {"stage": 11, "statement": "Low areas along Riverside Dr in Fair Bluff begin to flood."}]}, "images": {"probability": {"weekint": {"stage": "", "flow": "", "volume": ""}, "entperiod": {"stage": "", "flow": "", "volume": ""}, "shortrange": ""}, "hydrograph": {"default": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/hydrographs/fbln7_hg.png", "floodcat": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/hydrographs/fbln7_record.png"}, "photos": []}, "dataAttribution": [], "impactsLowWaters": [], "normalThreshold": {"value": 0, "units": "ft"}, "hydronotes": [], "datums": {"vertical": {"value": []}, "horizontal": {"value": []}, "notes": {"value": []}}, "inundation": {"enabled": false, "url": "", "zeroDatum": null, "downloads": null, "siteSpecificInfo": "", "dataAttribution": []}, "upstreamLid": "BRDN7", "downstreamLid": "NICS1", "inService": {"enabled": true, "message": ""}, "lowThreshold": null, "forecastReliability": "Graphical forecasts are not available during times of high